   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Chapter 13. Every layer has one job:\n- LoRA (0.6): contrast and mood\n- ControlNet Canny (0.7): product shape from the photo\n- weight 1.4 + 'white jar' in the negative: keeps the porcelain black\n- second pass (hi-res, denoise 0.45): detail\n- 4x model + scale down: print file.\nTest layers one by one: bypass a node (Ctrl+B) and compare.\n\nLICENCES (as of 26 Oct 2026 - check before selling):\n- SDXL base 1.0: CreativeML Open RAIL++-M - commercial use allowed, with a list of prohibited uses.\nNot legal advice.\n- 4x NMKD-Siax 200k: WTFPL (OpenModelDB). Alternative: Real-ESRGAN x4plus (BSD-3)."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
